    "control_profile": "cloud by default for cookie auth, bridge by default for bearer; explicit override required when worker kind differs. Raw send_events remains an escape hatch.",
    "command_results": "via=control carries worker result; via=worker carries enqueue ack only; via=local carries renderer result. A local handler is callable(args_string). Errors never silently become user messages.",
